        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b29da09-461f-44d7-9042-d4fde829b9f2).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome Agent 47 to Berlin\r\rYour targets are club owner Rolf Hirschmuller and confirmed ICA traitor Agent Montgomery. Apparently Agent Montgomery has been paid off by Mr Hirschmuller to look the other way when it comes to the ICA contract out on the club owner and has been hired instead by the Constant to eliminate you. Agent Montgomery has managed to recruit approximately 10 other ICA agents to his side and they are all on the lookout for you. We need to send a message and get the job done.",
